1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,300
"Server not reachable" means the dashboard
can't talk to the MIDI-GPT server.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,586
Generating now shows this error.

3
00:00:10,786 --> 00:00:16,871
Usually the server just isn't running.
Start it from the Desktop shortcut.

4
00:00:21,071 --> 00:00:23,229
Then click "Retry".

5
00:00:23,429 --> 00:00:29,371
The server runs on another computer?
Check its address with "Change...".

6
00:00:29,571 --> 00:00:34,871
The server's computer must also
allow connections on port 3456.
